    {
      "id": "Route215_Text_YupItsPayback",
      "en_US": [
        "Do unto others as they do unto\n",
        "you... Yup, it’s Payback!\r",
        "It’s good for Pokémon battles,\n",
        "but if you do that in real life...\r",
        "There’ll be no end to the fighting,\n",
        "that’s for sure.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Œil pour œil, dent pour dent...\n",
        "Ouais, c’est Représailles!\r",
        "C’est pratique pour les Pokémon,\n",
        "mais si on faisait pareil dans la vie...\r",
        "Les guerres n’auraient pas de fin.\n",
        "Imagine la catastrophe!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route215_Text_PaybackIsHarsh",
      "en_US": [
        "As I said, Payback is harsh.\r",
        "Use it after the foe, and its power\n",
        "gets doubled!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Avec Représailles, c’est sans merci. \r",
        "Utilise cette capacité après une\n",
        "attaque pour doubler sa puissance!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route215_Text_DontOverdoIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Jogging is good for you, but you have\n",
        "to make sure you’re not overdoing it!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Le jogging, c’est bon pour la santé,\n",
        "mais faut pas en faire trop!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route215_Text_ImOnlyHuman",
      "en_US": [
        "I slow down and stop at times, sure.\n",
        "I’m only human, after all."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bien sûr que je fais des pauses, des \n",
        "fois. Je suis humain, après tout."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route215_Text_SignCelesticTownSolaceonTown",
